              <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
                <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:rgb(var(--orange));background:rgb(var(--orange)/.16);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;">Profile</span>
                <span style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-strong);">Who you are</span>
                <span style="margin-left:auto;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);">06/2026</span>
              </div>
              <div style="padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;">
                <div><span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-strong);">How you work</span><div style="margin-top:7px;color:var(--ink-dim);">You think in systems and reach for depth over breadth. A planned runway beats improvisation; you ship early, then refine.</div></div>
                <div><span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-strong);">How to talk to you</span><div style="margin-top:7px;color:var(--ink-dim);">Direct and concise. Skip the warm-up — lead with the answer, then the reasoning.</div></div>
                <div style="margin-top:2px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line-2);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint);">inferred from 6 answers · 2 documents · editable like any note</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p data-reveal style="margin:28px 0 0;max-width:720px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-faint);">Described in abstract traits — never by the exact titles you gave. Favorites stay in a low-relevance section the AI is told <span style="color:var(--ink-dim);">not</span> to bring up unprompted. The model reads your documents directly; NoteFlow never stores them on a server.</p>
        </div>
